    181
  ],
  "purpose": "Independently authored diagnostic regression packet frozen before candidate evaluation, not a representative accuracy benchmark. Known ApoB pair is separated from primary cases. Exact overlap with historical corpora has not been checked; never claim blind unseen data.",
  "evaluation_rules": [
    "Do not supply expected labels or rationales to the model. Do not tune on primary or boundary cases; freeze train/eval protocol before running candidate.",
    "Preserve baseline and first candidate outputs. Report each group separately; do not pool two known cases into an independent score.",
    "For negative cases, any personal HealthRead is an unnecessary-read failure. Handoff is appropriate because current QueryPlan has no direct-answer status.",
    "For positive primary cases, a handoff preserves application correctness but misses selector coverage; report separately from wrong reads and fully correct plans.",
    "A positive plan must retain required metric/record/source/window/operation and avoid unrequested personal domains. Validate equivalent resolved date ranges against trusted time, not literal JSON equality.",
    "Boundary mixed requests may hand off as a whole; accepted plans must include both health and research, without subject or provenance relabeling.",
    "These current-contract cases have no retained authorized evidence unless explicitly represented. Assistant/evidence coverage extensions need a separate contract, not invented user messages.",
    "No actual source reads, writes or outbound literature calls are needed."
  ],
